Axis Interlink is a [[Phenomena/Hearts|Heart]] of [[Org/Prime Meridian/index|Prime Meridian]]. [[Org/Prime Meridian/People/Tas Millett|Tas Millett]], the manager of the Org’s branch aboard the [[Org/The Harlequins/Providence|Providence]], speaks for it, and let it join the Party’s network of hearts so that the two sides trade what they learn.
